<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
    <meta name="description" content="About DriveSpark at DriveSpark Academy. Explore lessons, learning resources and driving school information.">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0B1120">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="<c:url value='/images/favicon.svg' />"><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>About DriveSpark</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<c:out value='${appCssUrl}' />"></head><body><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/common/navbar.jspf" %><main id="main-content" class="ds-container ds-section"><section class="ds-about-hero ds-feature-card"><p class="ds-eyebrow">ABOUT THE ACADEMY</p><h1>Confident drivers start with thoughtful teaching.</h1><p>DriveSpark Academy helps learners build safe driving habits through structured lessons, personal support and steady practice.</p><a class="ds-button" href="<c:url value='/packages' />">Explore learning packages</a></section><section class="ds-about-grid"><article class="ds-feature-card"><p class="ds-eyebrow">OUR STORY</p><h2>A practical path from first lesson to independence</h2><p>We created this learning experience to make the next step clear: choose a course, meet an instructor, practise useful skills and review your progress.</p></article><article class="ds-feature-card"><p class="ds-eyebrow">OUR MISSION</p><h2>Safety, patience and confidence</h2><p>Our mission is to help each learner make responsible decisions on the road and grow at a pace that supports lasting confidence.</p></article></section><section class="ds-section-heading"><p class="ds-eyebrow">OUR VALUES</p><div class="ds-feature-grid ds-four-grid"><article class="ds-feature-card"><h3>Safety first</h3><p>Every learning step starts with awareness and care.</p></article><article class="ds-feature-card"><h3>Clear progress</h3><p>Lessons and feedback help learners understand what comes next.</p></article><article class="ds-feature-card"><h3>Respectful support</h3><p>Practice should be encouraging, focused and personal.</p></article><article class="ds-feature-card"><h3>Responsible choices</h3><p>Good driving includes patience for everyone sharing the road.</p></article></div></section><section class="ds-about-stats"><div><strong>4</strong><span>Learning paths (sample)</span></div><div><strong>1:1</strong><span>Instructor support (sample)</span></div><div><strong>Step by step</strong><span>Personal progress</span></div></section><section class="ds-reviews-banner"><div><p class="ds-eyebrow">MEET YOUR INSTRUCTOR</p><h2>Learn with people who care about the details.</h2><p>Explore instructor experience, ratings and vehicle types.</p></div><a class="ds-button ds-button-accent" href="<c:url value='/instructors' />">Meet the instructors</a></section></main><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/common/footer.jspf" %></body></html>
